      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The M-11 Wraith is a single-shot combat shotgun that sacrifices fire rate for kinetic devastation. Each round must be manually cycled, but the single shell it chambers carries enough mass-accelerated shot to drop a Phantom through their kinetic barrier in one blast. Originally designed for breach-and-clear operations, Cerberus tacticians found its two-shell capacity insufficient for sustained combat - the operatives using it countered that if two shots aren't enough, the problem was aim, not capacity.</p>"
